      "body": "\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\n- PaliGemma currently produces incorrect multimodal outputs in vLLM. vLLM applies causal attention to all tokens, while PaliGemma requires bidirectional attention for image tokens (PrefixLM).  #14565\r\n\r\nFixing it depends on FlexAttention soft-cap support, with no clear timeline #27938. Recommendation: deprecate the model family, or at minimum raise a hard error for multimodal use and document the limitation prominently.\r\n\r\n\r\n- We need to optimize the logging for chunked prefill and prefix caching for the PrefixLM model.\r\n\r\n```\r\n(APIServer pid=8064) DEBUG 11-03 22:25:57 [config/model.py:2259] Generative models support chunked prefill.\r\n(APIServer pid=8064) DEBUG 11-03 22:25:57 [config/model.py:2314] Generative models support prefix caching.\r\n(APIServer pid=8064) DEBUG 11-03 22:25:57 [engine/arg_utils.py:3055] Enabling chunked prefill by default\r\n(APIServer pid=8064) DEBUG 11-03 22:25:57 [engine/arg_utils.py:3083] Enabling prefix caching by default\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/44965a10974ee417f6f937eee207409462b2a0ab/vllm/v1/engine/core.py#L281-L301\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/44965a10974ee417f6f937eee207409462b2a0ab/vllm/config/model.py#L2265\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Claims\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Details\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [ ] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\r\n- [ ] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\r\n\r\n- [ ] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\r\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\r\n- [ ] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\r\n- [ ] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
